# Auto commit & deploy — Mind & Venture (MV2)

After completing substantive work in this repo, **commit and push without asking**.

## When to commit

- Game code (`index.html`, `js/**`, `sw.js`), assets, maps, and player-facing fixes
- Do **not** commit IDE junk (`.vs/`, `DocumentLayout*.json`, `.suo`, backup files)
- Do **not** commit secrets or large binary blobs unrelated to the task
- Do **not** commit unless there are real changes (no empty commits)

## Workflow

1. `git status` and `git diff` — stage only files related to the task
2. Write a concise commit message (1–2 sentences, focus on why)
3. `git add` → `git commit` → `git push origin main`
4. Briefly tell the user: commit hash, push succeeded, and that **GitHub Pages** (`https://paulooventura.github.io/MV2/`) deploys from `main` automatically

## Remote

- Repo: `https://github.com/paulooventura/MV2.git`
- Branch: `main`
- Root: `C:\Users\PVProductions\.cursor\Home\MIND-AND-VENTURE`

## Do not

- Force-push, amend pushed commits, or skip hooks unless the user explicitly asks
- Stage entire `.vs/` folders or unrelated C# Unity experiments unless the user asked for those
